      <div class="card"><div class="card-body prose">
        <h2>What file types do you accept?</h2>
        <p>STL and 3MF are most common. We can also work with STEP/OBJ depending on the project.</p>

        <h2>I don’t have a file — can you still help?</h2>
        <p>Yes. Choose <em>“Not sure (please advise)”</em> in the quote form and describe what you need. If you have measurements or reference photos, include them.</p>

        <h2>Do you offer same-day prints?</h2>
        <p>Same-day local options are available on request in Cambridgeshire, depending on workload and part complexity.</p>
      </div></div>

      <div class="card"><div class="card-body prose">
        <h2>How do I send my file?</h2>
        <p>Use the <a href="/quote/">quote form</a> to upload up to 10MB. If your file is larger, share a link (Drive/Dropbox/WeTransfer).</p>

        <h2>Do you publish a price list?</h2>
        <p>No — pricing is project-based. We quote based on material, complexity, quantity and turnaround.</p>

        <h2>Do you support business orders?</h2>
        <p>Yes — invoices provided, purchase orders accepted, NDA available on request, sample approval and repeat production supported.</p>
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
